    "show_share": true,
    "description": "This year's Author's Day at the Aga Khan University was special as it coincided with the University's 40th anniversary year of celebration. The theme across the campuses was  '40 Years of Excellence in Knowledge'  to celebrate the impact of AKU authors and writers.",
